Shift the magic bar Y by TrifoolBeat_MagicBarYOffset() in Interface_DrawMagicBar
so Beat 2.1 can reserve 3px of vertical room for the medallion-count display
once the Sages' Charm is held. Weak-symbol default returns 0, so a Shipwright
build without the TrifoolPercent module is pixel-identical to vanilla.

Upstream parallel: scripts/statics/interface.c:241 Patched_MagicBarSetup
